{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1000_019min", "source_sha256": "92e0db1199ff2b298c5e28279111b1645adfa54855798b453e0a721d46c237d9", "ja": "でも静香ちゃん、どうしてかつおぶし持ってるの？", "zh": "不过静香，你为什么带着柴鱼片呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "bfc3bd5e0eb6c1fef0a65c21b95ea5a2ff8eba4b785a66512ac1f63ec4d4ec22", "ja": "あ、お昼にトッピングしようと思って\n持ってきてたんです。", "zh": "啊，我本来想中午加点料，\n所以就带来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "619911a5d19a1da67f2d478d9d755dd1bdc03136f4cd5f11d474542ff5ec07b7", "ja": "そっかぁ、かつおぶしって何にでも合うもんね！\nかつおぶし炒飯もいいなあ。", "zh": "这样啊，柴鱼片和什么都很搭呢！\n柴鱼片炒饭也不错呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1003_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1004_p", "source_sha256": "fcd5228efcfadbf311addac26b68c05dc06b2e287d19d33e4149dc6ec9834d55", "ja": "みんな、お待たせ。\n悪いな、お昼時にミーティングなんて。", "zh": "大家，久等了。\n抱歉啊，午休时间还开会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "730b450d5a137eabed82238c07dec55cb324d8460e74aead75d055dd97674e58", "ja": "ほんとだよ！　兄ちゃんのオニ！アクマ！ネコマンマ！\n亜美お腹すいた～！", "zh": "就是嘛！兄长是坏蛋！恶魔！猫饭！\n亚美肚子饿了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "526d54c08f9f1448a7f2b36f40b79089d60d9cc65b3ba4f3b1290500bdf3eb46", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\nかつおぶし炒飯とラーメンと肉まんでいいですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n柴鱼炒饭、拉面和肉包，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bc7584b2058fde7e74d308d52db9cc94ff0d24fb5347b8765f105e171f743f44", "ja": "えっと……昼飯の話か？　その前に軽く話ができると\n助かるんだけど……ひとまずは、これじゃダメかな？", "zh": "那个……是在说午饭吗？在那之前要是能先简单聊几句的话就好了……总之，先这样不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1008_se", "source_sha256": "1c49d46398286da48800ba373f06000119ac7f3a99e220b2e4c6bf6e71bf1366", "ja": "ガサッ", "zh": "（沙沙）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "a7d7124667f1271ea3cbd1711ee86f7bae83a2e6d49f8dc02e40e396066b355b", "ja": "うわ～タイヤキだ～！　兄ちゃん愛してるー！", "zh": "哇～是鲷鱼烧～！大哥我爱死你啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "2d1d808309d12d050bc01d83d06e55a331e068ecd25ceb95cf35039387567826", "ja": "それなら亜美ちゃん、私のもあげるわ。\nお昼ご飯も、私は大丈夫かな。ごめんね美奈子ちゃん。", "zh": "那样的话，亚美，我的也给你吧。\n午饭的话，我应该没问题吧。对不起，美奈子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "3c905fdfe484f9542e1b846f72c1fd2de2bb45dc6f7ecef8a52774a434aab054", "ja": "えっ、タイヤキふたつももらっていいの？\nうわ～このみんもっと愛してるー！！", "zh": "诶，可以拿两个鲷鱼烧吗？\n哇～我更爱你了，小此美——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "e13adb75283d430e6a6172703835eefdf64f11336abc3c0412840feac734808a", "ja": "でも平気なの、このみさん。\nそれじゃ、完全にお昼抜きってことでしょ？", "zh": "可是，这样真的没关系吗，木实姐？那不就等于完全不吃午饭了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "ceb1f30dcf4e550c8dc5d0f65f0586c174ffccc20b4352da9a2785c52ed703dc", "ja": "今日はちょっと色々控えたいの。\nプロテインはあるから大丈夫！　ありがとね。", "zh": "今天我想稍微控制一下饮食。\n我有蛋白粉，所以没关系！谢谢你啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "ed19d96aa23b5720a7a16cb4fa6c6f04ddeb3bf19543d4a26af39969ec467164", "ja": "？　もしかして、糖質制限とかですか？", "zh": "？难道是在控制糖分之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "38566e7f5c686ab1d192378dbb8a935910dc43ef12c2dc10b7e6c8bbfa2c9d68", "ja": "そうなの、昨日グルメロケで張りきりすぎちゃって……\n大人になると、細胞が消費してくれないのよね～。", "zh": "是啊，昨天在美食外景拍摄时太卖力了……\n人一上了年纪，细胞就不会帮忙消耗掉了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "fcc997d805e71b15888553962b914a3b87ea607d5dedbe608b82e35be90e247e", "ja": "そっか、食べ盛りじゃないから……わかりました！\n今度糖質低めの、エビとか鶏肉料理を作ってきますね♪", "zh": "这样啊，因为我已经不是长身体的时候了……明白了！下次我做些低碳水的虾类或鸡肉料理带来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "3ad791e23bfbd53d8b4372a4b06ee3557b9ccfdfc24cf31d2c5285c5656c5e40", "ja": "え！　それってすごくありがたいかも。\n助かるわ、美奈子ちゃん！", "zh": "诶！那可真是帮大忙了。\n谢谢你，美奈子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "f84aca065368d3d63efe33a604c13746e0d1c11d9ddca8ead55f108ce8cb9f08", "ja": "任せてください。最近は弟のために、\n食材ごとのカロリー計算もバッチリです！", "zh": "交给我吧。最近为了弟弟，我连每种食材的热量都算得一清二楚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1019_p", "source_sha256": "46a27af901e285f7d15553dca8090e3dee7ec04e7a7ab6f8f5e3a8364a750ba9", "ja": "美奈子の気遣いが、ますます細やかになってきたな……\nこの曲に、なおさらピッタリだ。", "zh": "美奈子考虑得越来越周到了啊……\n和这首歌就更相配了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "f8999eae1187ac5aca7daebc69bfe438a0abd55c34d113107931035c540a9b42", "ja": "え？　この曲って……？", "zh": "咦？这首歌是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1021_p", "source_sha256": "2cdb5167ea2f0b3a19edf51551a227e8924da191ea63a6f33c4e0572460fb852", "ja": "今度の公演で歌ってもらう美奈子の新曲だよ。\nデモが届いたから、急いで集まってもらったんだ。", "zh": "这是下次公演要让美奈子演唱的新歌。\n因为小样送到了，所以赶紧把大家召集过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "0e900b3e977fc92e74f60f33d0007af1e83df86724298ef1d28ef4d950a725e0", "ja": "……！　ありがとうございます！　聴きたいです！", "zh": "……！非常感谢您！我想听！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "5a12e02586dc455a86ed923ac8e8e4fe675c64f9a0fb9a15242a72759aeabf40", "ja": "でかした兄ちゃん！　お昼休みをつぶしたことは\nオメメに見てあげるよ！　早く〜、3、2、1、ゴー！", "zh": "干得漂亮，哥哥！占用午休时间的事就睁一只眼闭一只眼啦！快点——3、2、1，开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1024_p", "source_sha256": "7749d04622b3c203ba650f7c92918c4b363c22034ae27785a061b0c3b357d6d9", "ja": "何を見てるのか知らないが、楽しみなのはわかった。\nそれじゃ……", "zh": "虽然不知道你在看什么，但我知道你很期待。\n那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "0ccb0200b9735f6d7e7058bc7a1094467ce45dded606d9a1f7356dd75441b37d", "ja": "わぁ……すごく、優しい曲ですね。", "zh": "哇……真是一首非常温柔的歌呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "d937016576c02168fe64ad03ba0b903840638661ca7f3da4780fbfe4291c8f7c", "ja": "本当ね。今までも美奈子ちゃんの曲は\nみんなを励ましてくれる感じだったけど……", "zh": "真的呢。一直以来，美奈子的歌也总给人一种鼓励大家的感觉，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "641b5c2c5f501093a1e2af76f3ee9fcd40f82378601e912cfa52f1a9c197ab41", "ja": "この曲は、そっと寄り添ってくれるっていうか。\n近くてあったかい気がするわ。", "zh": "这首歌给人的感觉，就是会静静地陪在身边。\n感觉距离很近，也很温暖呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "d8694ac885b3e5ce15c5dd3fcf1b128e2a7d4b23f3ed9f8eb96ddfe6cd42b3ae", "ja": "うん。それに、なんだか大人っぽい。\n桃子、こういうのも好きだな。", "zh": "嗯。而且，总觉得很有成熟感。\n桃子也喜欢这样的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1030_p", "source_sha256": "ece2aa78b5db6b664460d70e5f200fb8a9f7796ed7614a84c5cb793f800e8aa9", "ja": "今回は美奈子の、内側の魅力を、\n前面に出したかったんだ。……どうかな？", "zh": "这次想把美奈子内在的魅力展现出来。……你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "a5352e30a852d5f62eebad4819676099c3dc4e98adb3994cc2f8dd6c4b0b5f64", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nえへへ、とっても嬉しいです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n嘿嘿，我特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1032_019min", "source_sha256": "e4ec3d90cdd737ed0d703b626134d576145193b914a797d09d9c76dd0c2d8bd1", "ja": "優しくて、あったかくて……\n私、早くステージで歌いたいです！", "zh": "您温柔又体贴，让人感觉暖暖的……\n我想早点在舞台上唱歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1033_p", "source_sha256": "9be81e26e8359c845ab22211302ad2b765eef3c877c9a19aa02c3161ca9f389b", "ja": "よかった。それじゃ早速、\n公演までのレッスンスケジュールを組んでいこう。", "zh": "太好了。那我们马上来安排一下演出前的练习日程吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1034_019min", "source_sha256": "9edd11ac367f67de805fc9bd59e595ecfd9f94456ff477b0b1782426ed6a980c", "ja": "はい！　よろしくお願いします！\n私、頑張りますね！", "zh": "好的！请多多指教！\n我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "06f4ea34a2ef92dc133476592b29a899c16a6ba4dd134e923d767e192c3c8d3b", "ja": "私も、ちゃんと美奈子さんを支えられるように、\n頑張ります！", "zh": "我也会努力，争取能够好好支持美奈子小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1036_011ami", "source_sha256": "3835968d6efca1687b6f265a8ce70610ce692a65075f8a1fbac254ec493f05af", "ja": "うんうん、亜美もめっちゃ支えるかんね！\nみなりんはオーブネに乗ったつもりでどんぶらこだよ！", "zh": "嗯嗯，亚美也会全力支持你的！\n美奈凛就放宽心，坐在大船上随波摇荡吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_146_1037_019min", "source_sha256": "b2e5da7882144a742719eb23a30e7c353428f81d5a5d06d4c60e676dc2d7fac5", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとう。\nみんなも、公演までよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢。大家也请在公演前多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
